# Landing: branch + commit + push + PR-merge(fast-forward) of origin/main
$ git -C primary checkout -b fm/firstmate-learnings-convergence-20261012   (carries the uncommitted bytes)
Switched to a new branch 'fm/firstmate-learnings-convergence-20261012'

$ git -C primary add data/learnings.md && git commit -m 'Land restored fleet learnings'
landed commit: ab6cb27746fd025ed0e6af9781c0cd45ba256c08

$ git -C primary status --porcelain (empty == tree goes clean)
[end status]

$ git -C primary show --stat --oneline -s HEAD
ab6cb27 Land restored fleet learnings

$ git push origin HEAD:refs/heads/fm/firstmate-learnings-convergence-20261012  (the PR branch)
pushed.

$ origin: fast-forward main to the landed commit (the PR merge)
origin/main -> ab6cb27

$ git -C primary checkout main   (back to the tracked branch; tree clean)
primary HEAD: c3ce0ab (main)
[end status]
